# Counting usage. Everything here is optional, and the default is off.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are written into the build by `next build`, so a change
# needs a new build. Leave the provider unset (or empty, or `none`) and the
# build contains no analytics script and sends nothing. Set these for the
# production build only. See docs/DEPLOY.md before switching them on.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=plausible
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_SRC=https://plausible.io/js/script.tagged-events.js
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_ENDPOINT=
